# Binary files must never be line-ending converted. core.autocrlf is true on
# this machine, and without this git treats these as text: it "normalises" them
# on commit and converts them back on checkout, which shows a file as modified
# when its bytes are identical and can genuinely corrupt one on a fresh clone.
# The app icon was showing as permanently modified for exactly this reason.
*.ico  binary
*.png  binary
*.PNG  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.rar  binary
*.msix binary
*.exe  binary
